-  CSS colors it.
-- **No fetch, no CDN**: data ships as scripts (`file://` must work); d3 is vendored at
-  `site/assets/vendor/d3.min.js` with its LICENSE.
+- **A still layout.** The simulation runs `SETTLE_TICKS` steps before the first paint and
